  (text "Adapted from Radxa ZERO 3E V1.2 sheet 18 (Power IN).\nCHANGED vs the 3E: the 5 V rail now comes from the on-board PoE converter (VOUT_5V, see 30_poe.net)\ninstead of the USB-C power port. J2 stays as an internal SERVICE port: USB2 OTG for factory flashing\n(rockusb / maskrom) and, through D30, a bench supply so the board can be flashed without a PoE switch." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 25.4 0)
